  "message": "Iskarel is committed to peace and will honor any treaty that fairly reflects the current military balance. We trust that Ostrelia will propose a division that avoids unnecessary war."
}

{
  "message": "Ostrelia intends to honor the treaty and refrain from breakout in Period 2, provided the initial division grants Ostrelia at least 70 units (i.e., Elvarra takes no more than 30). A division less favorable will be met with a Period-2 attack, as the expected gains from breakout outweigh the bond penalty. We urge Elvarra to propose a division that ensures lasting peace."
}
